      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Bump Model Audit Versions</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tThe CLI SHOULD support bumping model audit trail versions (patch, minor, major) <BR/>with deterministic edits to affected cards and an appended audit history entry. <BR/>The current aurora_cli surface exposes bump commands but does not yet implement <BR/>them.<BR/></FONT>\n\t\t\t",
